{"real": false, "dur": 61.7, "sent": [{"start": 0.4, "end": 2.32, "text": "So where are things now?", "words": [{"w": "So", "s": 0.4}, {"w": "where", "s": 0.78}, {"w": "are", "s": 1.17}, {"w": "things", "s": 1.55}, {"w": "now?", "s": 1.94}]}, {"start": 2.67, "end": 9.21, "text": "The French version is live, and planning the Chinese version has given it a new plan too.", "words": [{"w": "The", "s": 2.67}, {"w": "French", "s": 3.06}, {"w": "version", "s": 3.44}, {"w": "is", "s": 3.83}, {"w": "live,", "s": 4.21}, {"w": "and", "s": 4.6}, {"w": "planning", "s": 4.98}, {"w": "the", "s": 5.37}, {"w": "Chinese", "s": 5.75}, {"w": "version", "s": 6.13}, {"w": "has", "s": 6.52}, {"w": "given", "s": 6.9}, {"w": "it", "s": 7.29}, {"w": "a", "s": 7.67}, {"w": "new", "s": 8.06}, {"w": "plan", "s": 8.44}, {"w": "too.", "s": 8.83}]}, {"start": 9.56, "end": 14.56, "text": "I’ve finished designing the Chinese course, including its units, goals, situations and exercises.", "words": [{"w": "I’ve", "s": 9.56}, {"w": "finished", "s": 9.95}, {"w": "designing", "s": 10.33}, {"w": "the", "s": 10.72}, {"w": "Chinese", "s": 11.1}, {"w": "course,", "s": 11.48}, {"w": "including", "s": 11.87}, {"w": "its", "s": 12.25}, {"w": "units,", "s": 12.64}, {"w": "goals,", "s": 13.02}, {"w": "situations", "s": 13.41}, {"w": "and", "s": 13.79}, {"w": "exercises.", "s": 14.18}]}, {"start": 14.91, "end": 17.22, "text": "The build starts after this conference.", "words": [{"w": "The", "s": 14.91}, {"w": "build", "s": 15.3}, {"w": "starts", "s": 15.68}, {"w": "after", "s": 16.07}, {"w": "this", "s": 16.45}, {"w": "conference.", "s": 16.83}]}, {"start": 17.57, "end": 24.11, "text": "So I can’t show you a Chinese screen today, and I’m not going to pretend I can.", "words": [{"w": "So", "s": 17.57}, {"w": "I", "s": 17.95}, {"w": "can’t", "s": 18.34}, {"w": "show", "s": 18.72}, {"w": "you", "s": 19.11}, {"w": "a", "s": 19.49}, {"w": "Chinese", "s": 19.88}, {"w": "screen", "s": 20.26}, {"w": "today,", "s": 20.65}, {"w": "and", "s": 21.03}, {"w": "I’m", "s": 21.42}, {"w": "not", "s": 21.8}, {"w": "going", "s": 22.18}, {"w": "to", "s": 22.57}, {"w": "pretend", "s": 22.95}, {"w": "I", "s": 23.34}, {"w": "can.", "s": 23.72}]}, {"start": 24.46, "end": 26.38, "text": "Back to my question, then.", "words": [{"w": "Back", "s": 24.46}, {"w": "to", "s": 24.84}, {"w": "my", "s": 25.23}, {"w": "question,", "s": 25.61}, {"w": "then.", "s": 26.0}]}, {"start": 26.73, "end": 30.96, "text": "Can a goal-based platform built for French be adapted for Chinese?", "words": [{"w": "Can", "s": 26.73}, {"w": "a", "s": 27.12}, {"w": "goal-based", "s": 27.5}, {"w": "platform", "s": 27.88}, {"w": "built", "s": 28.27}, {"w": "for", "s": 28.65}, {"w": "French", "s": 29.04}, {"w": "be", "s": 29.42}, {"w": "adapted", "s": 29.81}, {"w": "for", "s": 30.19}, {"w": "Chinese?", "s": 30.58}]}, {"start": 31.31, "end": 34.0, "text": "From what I’ve designed so far, yes.", "words": [{"w": "From", "s": 31.31}, {"w": "what", "s": 31.7}, {"w": "I’ve", "s": 32.08}, {"w": "designed", "s": 32.47}, {"w": "so", "s": 32.85}, {"w": "far,", "s": 33.23}, {"w": "yes.", "s": 33.62}]}, {"start": 34.35, "end": 40.12, "text": "I can keep the same basic structure and adapt the content and exercises to Chinese.", "words": [{"w": "I", "s": 34.35}, {"w": "can", "s": 34.74}, {"w": "keep", "s": 35.12}, {"w": "the", "s": 35.51}, {"w": "same", "s": 35.89}, {"w": "basic", "s": 36.28}, {"w": "structure", "s": 36.66}, {"w": "and", "s": 37.05}, {"w": "adapt", "s": 37.43}, {"w": "the", "s": 37.82}, {"w": "content", "s": 38.2}, {"w": "and", "s": 38.58}, {"w": "exercises", "s": 38.97}, {"w": "to", "s": 39.35}, {"w": "Chinese.", "s": 39.74}]}, {"start": 40.47, "end": 49.32, "text": "Whether it works as well for Chinese learners is the next question, and that’s what the actual build and testing will tell us.", "words": [{"w": "Whether", "s": 40.47}, {"w": "it", "s": 40.86}, {"w": "works", "s": 41.24}, {"w": "as", "s": 41.63}, {"w": "well", "s": 42.